To be used when the range of identities can be represented
as a numeric range (e.g., MSISDN ranges).""" ;
    rdfs:domain <urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/msisdnRanges> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<urn:3gpp:sa5:_3gpp-5gc-nrm-nrffunction/nfInfo/nfInstanceId> a rdf:Property ;
